{"sections":[{"slug":"Pontryagin对偶","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Pontryagin对偶"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Pontryagin <span lang=\"zh\">对偶</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Pontryagin 对偶"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">局部紧</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $\\mathsf{LCA}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/局部紧Abel群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">局部紧</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其中态射为连续同态</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $\\mathbb T = \\mathbb{R}/\\mathbb{Z}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为圆环</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">定义局部紧</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> <strong></strong>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Pontryagin对偶","text":"Pontryagin <span lang=\"zh\">对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">为</span>\n$$\r\n\\widehat G = \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{LCA}}(G,\\mathbb T).\r\n$$\n(<span lang=\"zh\">配备紧开拓扑</span>.) <span lang=\"zh\">这给出函子</span> $\\widehat{(-)}\\colon \\mathsf{LCA}^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to \\mathsf{LCA}$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">自然同态</span> $G \\to \\widehat {\\widehat {G}}$, $x\\mapsto (\\chi\\mapsto \\chi(x))$ <span lang=\"zh\">是同构</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对偶函子复合两次是恒等</span>: $\\widehat{(-)}\\circ \\widehat{(-)}^{\\mathrm{op}}\\simeq\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathsf{LCA}}$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\widehat {\\mathbb{Z}}\\simeq \\mathbb T$, $\\widehat {\\mathbb T}\\simeq\\mathbb{Z}$.</li>\n<li>$\\widehat {\\mathbb{R}} \\simeq \\mathbb{R}$.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">紧</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">离散对偶</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">为紧群</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $\\widehat {G}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为离散群</span>.</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">为离散群</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $\\widehat {G}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为紧群</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"/调和分析","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">调和分析</span>"}},{"Plain":"</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Fourier变换","text":"Fourier <span lang=\"zh\">变换</span>"}},{"Plain":"</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}}]}